WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
I am the messenger of the Northern Barbarians

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,120
This person hit me

3
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,440
If you don't give me an explanation

4
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,720
Just wait for the Beiman Iron Weapon

5
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:07,120
Damn you, stop it

6
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,680
Take these northern barbarians back

7
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:12,920
Waiting for your Lordship to judge Young Master Fang

8
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,360
Could you please come with us?

9
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,880
My son is going too

10
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,280
It’s about the Northern Barbarian envoys

11
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,600
Please also ask Mr. Fang to cooperate.

12
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,480
Is he going too?

13
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:24,760
It shouldn't be a problem for the former Duke's son to just let the guards take action.

14
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:28,000
Since I'm involved in this matter, it would be nice to go with you.

15
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,920
I admit that you are a man

16
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,820
I thought you wouldn't come

17
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,820
I'm just curious

18
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,940
The Northern Barbarians have all revealed their identities.

19
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,700
Why are you still taking action?

20
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:44,920
I can't stand others being so arrogant

21
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,920
You can suffer it if you want, and what else?

22
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,640
The Panfu clan has three religions and nine streams

23
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:49,800
They are all common people of Chu

24
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,480
This young master is a noble queen

25
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:52,920
Generations long for the great favor of Chu State

26
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,480
You should protect the people of Chu

27
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:59,080
If this matter does not fall on you, I will protect you Mu Ying from telling the truth.

28
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:03,580
I'm starting to appreciate you a little bit, but it's just the same

29
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:07,260
That Brother Chu next to you has nothing to do with him, so there is no need for him to come.
